<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan discount rate rises to 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Moldovan discount rate rises to 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's National Bank has raised its official discount rate to 21 percent annual from 20 percent effective since January 20, a National Bank official said.</p>
<p>The new rate was set at a credit funds auction on Monday, when 8 banks acquired a total of 9.6 million lei ($2.06 million) of National Bank reserves.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
